NAGE COSTS, AND REDUCE OR DEFER CAPITAL SPENDING.'}{'symbol': 'LOW', 'date': '2020-04-03 16:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Lowe's Temporarily Increases Hourly Wages And Implements New Safety Efforts In Response To Covid-19", 'text': "LOWE'S TEMPORARILY INCREASES HOURLY WAGES AND IMPLEMENTS NEW SAFETY EFFORTS IN RESPONSE TO COVID-19.LOWE'S COMPANIES INC - WILL BE CLOSING ALL STORES AT 7 P.M. DAILY TO ENSURE ADDITIONAL TIME TO REPLENISH ESSENTIAL PRODUCTS.LOWE'S COMPANIES - TEMPORARILY RAISING WAGES BY $2 AN HOUR FOR EVERY FULL-TIME, PART-TIME & SEASONAL HOURLY STORE.LOWE'S COMPANIES - EXTENDED EMERGENCY PAID LEAVE UP TO A TOTAL OF FOUR WEEKS FOR THOSE AT A HIGHER RISK FOR SEVERE ILLNESS FROM COVID-19.LOWE'S COMPANIES - TEMPORARILY RAISING WAGES BY $2 AN HOUR FOR EVERY CONTACT CENTER & SUPPLY CHAIN ASSOCIATES.LOWE'S COMPANIES - ACTIVELY HIRING 30,000 ASSOCIATES IN STORES ACROSS U.S..LOWE'S COMPANIES INC - SHIPPED AN ADDITIONAL 10,000 TRUCKLOADS OF ESSENTIAL PRODUCTS TO REPLENISH STORES.LOWE'S COMPANIES - TEMPORARILY INCREASING WAGES FOR ASSOCIATES BY $2 AN HOUR FOR HOURS THEY WORK THROUGHOUT MONTH OF APRIL IN U.S. AND CANADA."}{'symbol': 'NEM', 'date': '2020-04-03 02:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Newmont Says Ramping Down Peñasquito Operations', 'text': "FOLLOWING NEW GOVERNMENT RESTRICTIONS IN MEXICO, NEWMONT SAFELY RAMPING DOWN PEÑASQUITO OPERATIONS.NEWMONT - COMPANY IS CURRENTLY UNABLE TO DETERMINE EXTENT TO WHICH RAMP DOWN ACTIVITIES WILL IMPACT PEÑASQUITO'S PRODUCTION AND COSTS FOR 2020."}{'symbol': 'PFE', 'date': '2020-04-03 16:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Pfizer Receives European Approval For Oncology Biosimilar, Ruxience', 'text': 'PFIZER RECEIVES EUROPEAN APPROVAL FOR ONCOLOGY BIOSIMILAR, RUXIENCE™ (RITUXIMAB).PFIZER RECEIVES EUROPEAN APPROVAL FOR ONCOLOGY BIOSIMILAR, RUXIENCE™ (RITUXIMAB).PFIZER INC - EUROPEAN COMMISSION HAS APPROVED RUXIENCE.'}{'symbol': 'RTX', 'date': '2020-04-03 11:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Raytheon Technologies Withdrawing Collins Aerospace And Pratt & Whitney Financial Outlooks For 2020', 'text': "RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES - WITHDRAWING COLLINS AEROSPACE AND PRATT & WHITNEY FINANCIAL OUTLOOKS FOR 2020.RAYTHEON CO - COVID-19 PANDEMIC HAS SIGNIFICANTLY INCREASED GLOBAL ECONOMIC AND DEMAND UNCERTAINTY..RAYTHEON CO - NOT PROVIDING AN UPDATED OUTLOOK FOR THESE BUSINESSES AT THIS TIME.RAYTHEON - COVID-19 PANDEMIC MAY ALSO IMPACT RTC'S SUPPLY CHAINS.RAYTHEON - FINANCIAL IMPACT OF COVID-19 PANDEMIC CANNOT BE REASONABLY ESTIMATED AT THIS TIME."}{'symbol': 'ROST', 'date': '2020-04-03 13:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Ross Stores Prices $2 Billion 4-Part Senior Notes', 'text': 'ROSS STORES INC - PRICES $2 BILLION 4-PART SENIOR NOTES.ROSS STORES INC - PRICED $700 MILLION 4.600% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2025, $400 MILLION 4.700% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2027 AS PART OF 4-PART NOTES OFFERING.ROSS STORES INC - PRICED $400 MILLION 4.800% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2030, $500MLN 5.450% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2050 AS PART OF 4-PART NOTES OFFERING.'}{'symbol': 'TSLA', 'date': '2020-04-03 19:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Tesla Inc - In Q1, We Produced Almost 103,000 Vehicles And Delivered Approximately 88,400 Vehicles', 'text': 'TESLA Q1 2020 VEHICLE PRODUCTION & DELIVERIES.TESLA INC - IN Q1, WE PRODUCED ALMOST 103,000 VEHICLES AND DELIVERED APPROXIMATELY 88,400 VEHICLES.TESLA INC - MODEL Y PRODUCTION STARTED IN JANUARY AND DELIVERIES BEGAN IN MARCH, SIGNIFICANTLY AHEAD OF SCHEDULE.TESLA INC - ADDITIONALLY, OUR SHANGHAI FACTORY CONTINUED TO ACHIEVE RECORD LEVELS OF PRODUCTION, DESPITE SIGNIFICANT SETBACKS.TESLA INC QTRLY PRODUCTION OF MODEL S/X OF 15,390 VEHICLES.TESLA INC QTRLY MODEL 3/Y PRODUCTION OF 87,282 VEHICLES.TESLA INC - QTRLY MODEL S/X DELIVERIES 12,200 VEHICLES.TESLA INC - QTRLY MODEL 3/Y DELIVERIES OF 76,200 VEHICLES.'}{'symbol': 'TXT', 'date': '2020-04-03 17:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Textron Says On April 1 Entered Into A 364-Day Term Loan Credit Agreement', 'text': 'TEXTRON INC SAYS ON APRIL 1 ENTERED INTO A 364-DAY TERM LOAN CREDIT AGREEMENT - SEC FILING.TEXTRON INC - ENTERED INTO A 364-DAY TERM LOAN CREDIT AGREEMENT IN AN AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF $500 MILLION.TEXTRON INC - ON APRIL 2, 2020, TEXTRON BORROWED FULL AMOUNT AVAILABLE UNDER TERM LOAN AGREEMENT.'}{'symbol': 'TDG', 'date': '2020-04-03 20:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Transdigm Group Prices Offering Of $1,100 Million Of Senior Secured Notes', 'text': 'TRANSDIGM GROUP PRICES OFFERING OF $1,100 MILLION OF SENIOR SECURED NOTES.TRANSDIGM GROUP INC - UNIT PRICED PRIVATE OFFERING OF $1,100 MILLION OF 8.00% SENIOR SECURED NOTES DUE 2025.TRANSDIGM- ON APR. 2, WHOLLY-OWNED SUBSIDIARY PRICED PRIVATE OFFERING OF $1,100 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 8.00% SENIOR SECURED NOTES DUE 2025.TRANSDIGM GROUP - NOTES WILL BE ISSUED AT A PRICE OF 100% OF THEIR PRINCIPAL AMOUNT.TRANSDIGM GROUP INC - OFFERING IS EXPECTED TO CLOSE ON APRIL 8, 2020.'}{'symbol': 'UAA', 'date': '2020-04-03 11:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Under Armour Announces Actions To Address Financial Impacts Related To Covid-19', 'text': "UNDER ARMOUR ANNOUNCES ACTIONS TO ADDRESS FINANCIAL IMPACTS RELATED TO COVID-19, PROVIDES ADDITIONAL DETAIL ON ITS 2020 RESTRUCTURING PLAN.UNDER ARMOUR INC - EXTENSION OF CURRENT STORE CLOSURES UNTIL FURTHER NOTICE..UNDER ARMOUR INC - EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY, COMPANY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS WILL BE REDUCING ITS COMPENSATION BY 25%.UNDER ARMOUR INC - WILL TEMPORARILY LAY OFF TEAMMATES THAT WORK IN ITS U.S. BRAND (FULL PRICE) AND FACTORY HOUSE (OUTLET) STORES.UNDER ARMOUR INC - WILL TEMPORARILY LAY OFF APPROXIMATELY 600 TEAMMATES THAT WORK AT ITS U.S.-BASED DISTRIBUTION CENTERS..UNDER ARMOUR INC - COMPANY WILL TEMPORARILY LAY OFF APPROXIMATELY 600 TEAMMATES THAT WORK AT ITS U.S.-BASED DISTRIBUTION CENTERS.UNDER ARMOUR INC - COMPANY WILL BEGIN PAYING PREMIUM BONUSES TO ITS DISTRIBUTION CENTER TEAMMATES CONTINUING TO WORK DURING CRISIS.UNDER ARMOUR INC - ALL OF COMPANY'S EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENTS AND ABOVE WILL BE TAKING A 25% SALARY CUT THROUGH DURATION OF CRISIS.UNDER ARMOUR INC - WILL COVER FULL HEALTH BENEFITS FOR BENEFIT-ELIGIBLE TEAMMATES FOR APPROXIMATELY TWO MONTHS DURING THIS TEMPORARY LAYOFF PERIOD.UNDER ARMOUR INC - COMPANY EXPECTS TO INCUR TOTAL ESTIMATED PRE-TAX RESTRUCTURING AND RELATED CHARGES IN RANGE OF $475 MILLION TO $525 MILLION DURING 2020.UNDER ARMOUR INC - WITHDRAWN ITS Q1 AND FULL-YEAR 2020 OUTLOOK PROVIDED ON FEBRUARY 11, 2020.UNDER ARMOUR INC - WILL NOT OFFER AN UPDATED OUTLOOK AT THIS TIME."}{'symbol': 'WBA', 'date': '2020-04-03 20:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Walgreens Boots Alliance Says Co Entered Into Revolving Credit Agreement For $750 Mln Senior Unsecured Revolving Credit Facility', 'text': 'WALGREENS BOOTS ALLIANCE SAYS ON APRIL 1, CO ENTERED INTO REVOLVING CREDIT AGREEMENT FOR $750 MILLION SENIOR UNSECURED REVOLVING CREDIT FACILITY.WALGREENS BOOTS ALLIANCE SAYS AS OF APRIL 1, 2020, THERE WERE NO BORROWINGS OUTSTANDING UNDER REVOLVING CREDIT FACILITY - SEC FILING.'}{'symbol': 'DIS', 'date': '2020-04-03 20:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Walt Disney's Furlough Process Will Begin On April 19 - Spokesperson", 'text': "STATEMENT FROM THE WALT DISNEY COMPANY REGARDING CORONAVIRUS IMPACT.WALT DISNEY'S FURLOUGH PROCESS WILL BEGIN ON APRIL 19 - SPOKESPERSON.WALT DISNEY'S IMPACTED WORKERS WILL REMAIN DISNEY EMPLOYEES THROUGH THE DURATION OF FURLOUGH PERIOD - SPOKESPERSON."}